recommend keep-going -- the several-line interleave in mantra/src/weave.rye is still the lane's next real work and still wants your word, and this lap sharpened why: the widening is pinned by src/shape/shape-mantra-diff-field-count.glow AND by src/gate/gate-mantra-diff-fields-eq-u32.glow, and both now move together under one reader, so the cost of the widening is two placards rather than an unknown number of copies.
